# SIG Mission Controller

**Subsystem of the Starfield Intelligent Gallery (SIG) · TempleConsole**

The Mission Controller ingests, indexes, deduplicates, classifies, and serves
your entire Starfield screenshot archive — tens of thousands of images — from a
local SQLite database into the TempleConsole PySide6 interface.

---

## Quick Start (Windows)

```bat
cd C:\SIG
.venv\Scripts\activate

:: 1. Install dependencies
pip install -r mission_controller\requirements.txt

:: 2. Run the CLI ingestor against your default folder
python -m mission_controller.ingestion.run_ingest

:: 3. (Optional) also scan extra drives and run ML classification
python -m mission_controller.ingestion.run_ingest --path "D:\Starfield" --classify

:: 4. Run the full TempleConsole with Mission Controller integrated
python sig_launcher.py
```

