## Integration into TempleConsole

### Option A — Minimal (single tab widget)

```python
# In any SIG panel that has a QTabWidget, QSplitter, or layout:
from mission_controller.database import get_db
from mission_controller.ui import MissionControllerWidget

db = get_db()                          # opens ~/.temple_console/mission_controller.db
mc = MissionControllerWidget(db)
self.tab_widget.addTab(mc, "⬡  ARCHIVE")
```

### Option B — Full integration via sig_mission_controller_integration.py

```python
# Drop this anywhere in your CarrierDeck / CosmicChoicePanel:
import sig_mission_controller_integration as mc_integration
mc_widget = mc_integration.create_mc_widget(parent=self)
layout.addWidget(mc_widget)
```

See `sig_mission_controller_integration.py` for the complete wiring pattern.

