## SQLite Schema (v4)

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `images` | One row per canonical image — path, checksums, dimensions, EXIF, source, timestamps |
| `tags` | Tag vocabulary with category (`user` / `ml` / `system`) |
| `image_tags` | Many-to-many; stores confidence (1.0 = manual, 0–1 = ML) |
| `sources` | Watched directories / drives |
| `ingestion_runs` | Audit log of every scan run |
| `ml_results` | Raw per-model predictions per image |
| `schema_migrations` | Version tracking for safe forward migrations |

