## Safety & Privacy

- **No images are uploaded anywhere.** The entire pipeline is local-first.
- The SQLite database lives in `~/.temple_console/mission_controller.db` by default.
- Image bytes are never stored in the DB — only paths, checksums, and metadata.
- External drives are opt-in (`--external` flag or checkbox in UI).

